&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a class=&quot;cc-1sdo59k&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
