&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position&amp;nbsp;Type&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Expected&amp;nbsp;Hours&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt;This is a full-time position of 40 hours per week with typical working hours of Monday through Friday, 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Hours and work shifts may change &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt;in accordance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt; department and business needs. Employees in this role may &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt;be required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt; to work over &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt;40 hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt; per week with approval from the department manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65215418 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work&amp;nbsp;Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
