&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Senior Director,&amp;nbsp;Strategic Growth Initiatives &amp;amp; Transformation&amp;nbsp;is a highly influential individual contributor responsible for driving the&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;execution of&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&#39;s&amp;nbsp;highest-priority growth initiatives.&amp;nbsp;Partners across the enterprise&amp;nbsp;to bring&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;strategic growth opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;to life through disciplined execution, cross-functional leadership, and organizational alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role focuses on geographic expansion, new channel development, direct-to-consumer growth, social commerce, and other commercial opportunities. The Senior Director leads initiatives from desired business outcomes through implementation, adoption, and scale while partnering across Commercial, Sales, Marketing, Product Development, Operations, Planning, Supply Chain, Digital Technology, Analytics, Compliance, Finance, Customer Experience, and other key functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
