&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;Social &amp;amp; Influence Director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;London, United Kingdom - &lt;strong&gt;6 month FTC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting on the client Global Leadership Team, you&#39;ll define how one of the world&#39;s most iconic brands shows up on social — and lead the multi-market team that delivers it. You&#39;ll oversee social media managers, creator leads, and senior social experts across markets, building capability, setting standards, and driving a programme that is native to platform, culture, and audience. As the senior social adviser to the client&#39;s global team, you&#39;ll translate platform expertise into confident, clear strategic direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Platform Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define global social frameworks, standards, and best practice across client Social Studios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify platform opportunities, cultural moments, and emerging formats — and translate them into clear strategic action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the studio&#39;s social authority, championing platform-native thinking across creative and content output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creator &amp;amp; Influencer Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the client&#39;s end-to-end creator and influence programme — from strategy design through to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the programme in line with audience behaviour, platform developments, and brand values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee creator managers and a large UGC network, maintaining creative quality, brand alignment, and scalable delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate creator activity across markets and ensure consistent use of the Creator Bench&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Capability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a global, multi-disciplinary team of social media managers, creator managers, and senior social experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear objectives and build a culture of curiosity, craft, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach talent at all levels; create visible pathways for professional growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary social-craft partner to senior client stakeholders globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate platform expertise and audience insight into strategic counsel, platform reviews, and brand presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders, operating credibly at global marketing director level and above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content &amp;amp; Campaign Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put social insight, audience behaviour, and platform understanding at the centre of content and campaign planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set community management standards that consistently reflect the client&#39;s voice, values, and purpose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Budget Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee studio-level and creator programme budgets; present financial performance to client and OLIVER senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cost-effective delivery across a multi-market creator ecosystem — balancing quality, scale, and commercial health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the financial health of the social and creator discipline within the studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of social media at scale — across multiple markets, within a large brand, in-house studio, or agency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across major and emerging social platforms, with a strong, current read on the evolving landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and managing large creator ecosystems and influencer programmes, end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior client leadership skills — the credibility and clarity to advise at global marketing director level and above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational rigour: the ability to bring structure and clarity to complex, multi-market programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing multi-disciplinary social teams across geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience overseeing annual content or studio budgets and presenting financial performance to senior internal and client stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage creator or production spend at scale — balancing quality, efficiency, and commercial accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic integration of Gen AI tools across studio operations — including ideation, social listening, trend detection, creator sourcing, and community workflows&lt;/li&gt;
